     "text": "This is an open problem: the requested value of \\(d\\) is not currently known.\n\nThe **homogeneity conjecture for uniform bundles on projective space** asserts that every uniform vector bundle on \\(\\mathbb P^n_{\\mathbb C}\\) of rank \\(r<2n\\) is homogeneous. Thus:\n- \\(d=+\\infty\\) would establish that conjecture;\n- any finite value of \\(d\\) would identify the smallest-dimensional counterexample.\n\nNon-homogeneous uniform bundles are known in rank \\(2n\\), but that rank is excluded by the strict inequality in the question. Those examples therefore do not determine \\(d\\).\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{The exact value of }d\\text{ is unknown.}}\n\\]",
